	(text_box "The Bosch BMP390 has an identical package, footprint, and pinout to the BMP388.\nThe register maps for the two barometric pressure sensors are almost identical.\nThe two sensors are interchangable from a PCB perspective.\nThere are a few minor changes/additions to the BMP390 register map."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 63.5 0)
		(size 53.34 17.78)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c3ab777-27ad-4cfb-a8b2-edcb2a06ce26")
	)
	(text_box "NOTE: the following KiCad schematic and footprint are used in this design:\nPackage_LGA:Bosch_LGA-14_3x2.5mm_P0.5mm\nThis package is listed in the KiCad schematic library as being for the BMI160.\nI checked the pin assignments and footprint dimmensions for each sensor and feel comfortable using this schematic/footprint."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 48.26 0)
		(size 46.99 17.78)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
